<!-- .github/copilot-instructions.md: thin pointer so Copilot Chat in VS Code sees the same rules as the coding agent. -->

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root, including its Evergreen section: read `evergreen.json` before using any evergreen folder, refresh when due after finishing the task, record learnings when corrected or when the same error repeats, and treat `CODEMAP.md` as a possibly stale compass that must be verified against the code.
